# Riverglades (40-43): every Horde quest of the Riverglades in one stay, for a Horde duo: Rog'mar,
# Sunnyglade and Bolder'ok first, then Powderfuse Port and the Eastsea pirates, Na'zok's farm, the
# Bloodmaster's Ring, Da'grosh and the Twilight's Shroud.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/riverglades_40_43.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Riverglades, area 16591).
# The guide's quest list is sections 1 and 7 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md, which were
# two visits (40-41 and 44-45) until they were joined here: every quest of the zone can be taken at
# level 40, and the higher quests (levels 41 to 46, around Powderfuse Port and in the west) come
# after the lower ones. The hardest fights are at the very end and can be skipped: Executioner Morg
# and Overlord Kilgar (level 46 elites) in the Twilight's Shroud, Snufflesnout and Chub'chob (level
# 44 and 45 elites) in the Bloodmaster's Ring. Their steps say so.
# Left out: Key Ingredients (94974): it follows Krol'dok Moulding, a quest item dropped by Tunk in
# the Krol'dok Stronghold dungeon. A Token of Vengeance (94975), Tome of Twilight (94972) and Eye of
# Mugg (94968): dungeon quests, done inside Krol'dok Stronghold.
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack them): Twice Misplaced Trust (97332, Wharfmaster Lozgil in
# Booty Bay, from Stranglethorn Vale (36-37)), handed in to Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz at the goblin
# docks (Powderfuse Port).
# Not here: the two deliveries to Friz Frazzlespark from far away, Lost Shipping Crate (94895, a
# crate at Shadowprey Village in Desolace, level 36 to take) and Overseas Delivery (95144, the
# innkeeper of Gadgetzan). The route comes to their starts only after this guide (290 XP each).
# Left to later guides: I Know a Guy (95295, Booty Bay: Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows
# (41-43)), Shipping and Handling (95296, Steamwheedle Port: Tanaris (43-43)) and On the Other Side
# (95033, Camp Mojache: Feralas (45-46)).
# Data fixed here: Food for the Taking (93787) has no prerequisite (the data says A Message in
# Blood; outof.games and the quest giver offer both at once). Smuggler's Paradise (95288) needs The
# Goblin Trader (Horde) or A Few Furs for Friz (Alliance), not both. Paletusk Harvesting's Chunks of
# Boar Meat drop from the Mature Paletusks here (outof.games), which the data lacks.
#
# The route, with the hearthstone at Rog'mar all along: Rog'mar, then a flight to Undercity
# (Armory of Sunnyglade, the auction house, level 40 training) and the hearthstone back; the plains
# south-east of Rog'mar; a long loop west (Meadowsbrook, Turner's Logging Camp, the Cinderscale cave,
# the Bristle Hills); the river and Farholde; Sunnyglade twice; Bolder'ok and the first fights of the
# Bloodmaster's Ring; Rog'mar and a second flight to Undercity and back (Armory of Sunnyglade, training,
# the auction house); Powderfuse Port and three loops from it (the murloc shore, the Eastsea pirates,
# then Windstead, Na'zok's farm, the Jom-jom cave and Bolder'ok); Admiral Lamora's ships; the sea
# monster; Rog'mar; far west to Da'grosh and the Twilight's Shroud; the hearthstone to Rog'mar and
# the last fights of the Bloodmaster's Ring; Rog'mar's flight to Undercity and the zeppelin to
# Grom'gol, where Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43) starts.

guide Riverglades (40-43)
faction horde
levels 40 43
carry 243 669 1137 1240 1270 1373 1420 95141 95143 97332
leave 243 669 1137 1240 1270 1373 1420 95033 95295 95296
next Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43)

